@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ca-interpretation-nouns`
IMPORT `ca-interpretation-time`
IMPORT `ca-interpretation-calendar`
IMPORT `ca-interpretation-rules`
IMPORT `ca-interpretation-reading`
IMPORT `ca-interpretation-powers`
IMPORT `ca-interpretation-repeal`
