-- ===== Application (s.3) =====
#ASSERT `a provision of the Act applies to an enactment unless` FALSE   -- #31 s.3(1) enacted before (dup of #32; no date-of-enactment input)
#ASSERT `a provision of the Act applies to an enactment unless` FALSE   -- #32 s.3(1) enacted after (dup of #31)
