#ASSERT (`the endorsement the Clerk of the Parliaments shall make on an Act assented to on` (YMD 2024 6 20))'s `the day it records` EQUALS YMD 2024 6 20   -- #45 s.5(1)
#ASSERT (`the endorsement the Clerk of the Parliaments shall make on an Act assented to on` (YMD 2024 6 20))'s `it is a part of the Act`   -- #46 s.5(1)
#ASSERT `the date of commencement of an Act that provides none, assented to on` (YMD 2024 6 20) EQUALS YMD 2024 6 20   -- #47 s.5(2)
#ASSERT `the first day that starts at or after` (`the moment from which a provision postponing commencement is itself in force, for an Act assented to on` (YMD 2024 6 20)) EQUALS YMD 2024 6 20   -- #48 s.5(3) the postponing provision itself
#ASSERT NOT (`the day from which it binds` (`the coming into force of the provision of an Act` `facts of an Act, assented 2024-06-20, provision naming 2025-01-01`) EQUALS YMD 2024 6 20)   -- #49 s.5(3) the postponed portion
#ASSERT `the day from which it binds` (`the coming into force of the provision of an Act` `facts of an Act, assented 2024-06-20, naming no day`) EQUALS YMD 2024 6 20   -- #50 s.5(4) the remaining provision
#ASSERT `the day from which it binds` (`the coming into force of the provision of an Act` `facts of an Act, assented 2024-06-20, provision naming 2025-01-01`) EQUALS YMD 2025 1 1   -- #51 s.5(4) ss.1-3 themselves
-- GAP #52 s.5(4): no function for the precondition (some provision names another day)

