#ASSERT `two moments are the same instant` (`the commencement of an enactment that comes into force as` (`the coming into force of the provision of an Act` `facts of an Act, assented 2024-06-20, naming no day`)) `and` (`the commencement of` (YMD 2024 6 20))   -- #61 s.6(2)(a)
#ASSERT NOT `an enactment in force from` (`the expiration of` (YMD 2024 6 19)) `is in force on` (YMD 2024 6 19)   -- #62 s.6(2)(a) day-level proxy for 2024-06-19T23:59
#ASSERT `an enactment in force from` (`the expiration of` (YMD 2024 6 19)) `is in force on` (YMD 2024 6 20)   -- #63 s.6(2)(a) day-level proxy for 08:00 on the day of assent (hour of the day is a GAP)
#ASSERT `two moments are the same instant` (`the commencement of an enactment that comes into force as` (`the coming into force of a regulation` `facts of a regulation made 2024-03-10, naming no day, registered 2024-03-15, not exempt`)) `and` (`the commencement of` (YMD 2024 3 15))   -- #64 s.6(2)(b) registered
#ASSERT `two moments are the same instant` (`the commencement of an enactment that comes into force as` (`the coming into force of a regulation` `facts of a regulation made 2024-03-10, naming no day, registered 2024-03-15, exempted class`)) `and` (`the commencement of` (YMD 2024 3 10))   -- #65 s.6(2)(b) exempted class
#ASSERT `the day from which it binds` (`the coming into force of a regulation` `facts of a regulation made 2024-03-10, naming no day, registered 2024-03-15, not exempt`) EQUALS YMD 2024 3 15   -- #66 s.6(2)(b) not exempt
#ASSERT `an enactment in force from` (`the expiration of` (YMD 2024 3 14)) `is in force on` (YMD 2024 3 15)   -- #67 s.6(2)(b) day-level proxy for 00:30 before the hour of registration (hour of the day is a GAP)
#ASSERT `two moments are the same instant` (`the commencement of an enactment that comes into force as` (`the coming into force of a regulation` `facts of a regulation naming 2024-09-01`)) `and` (`the commencement of` (YMD 2024 9 1))   -- #68 s.6(1) regulation naming a day
